# Phase 2 / Task P2-5: explicit exclusions for anything that could ever
# carry real patient/worklist data or credentials. RN DOC Runner does not
# write most of these into the repo during normal operation today (a
# worklist import is read from its original on-disk location and never
# copied here; an OCR/PDF preview is rendered to the OS temp directory
# and deleted immediately after use — see apps/desktop/src/main/
# ipc-handlers.ts's worklist:previewRow handler) — these patterns exist
# as defense-in-depth against anything ever landing in the repo by
# accident or by a future change, not because it happens today.
worklists/
worklist-imports/
*.worklist.json
ocr-input/
ocr-output/
ocr-debug/
patient-data/
tmp-patient-data/
local-queue/
*.queue-state*.enc
*.session-state*.enc
*.session.json
*.session.enc
exports/
*.export.csv
*.export.json
screenshots/
*.screenshot.png
logs/
*.har
storageState.json
.auth/
*.cookies
*credentials*.json

